{"id":"n83939-2-7","stage":5,"title":"찾아들다 · 出现","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83939-2-7-1","ko":"밖이 벌써 깜깜해졌네.","zh":"外面已经黑透了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밖이","meaning":"外面，外边","explanation":"밖：外面，外边；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"4","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깜깜해졌네.","meaning":"漆黑，黑洞洞；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"깜깜하다：漆黑，黑洞洞；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"깜깜하다","audio":"/audio/c9c39abec1a0a2933c39.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38462","senseId":"1","lemma":"깜깜하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c54dd45d274b6e46","term":"밖","zh":"外面，外边","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3","entryId":"17878","definition":"不被某个包围的空间。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"c9c39abec1a0a293","term":"깜깜하다","zh":"漆黑，黑洞洞","audio":"/audio/c9c39abec1a0a2933c39.mp3","entryId":"38462","definition":"非常暗，什么都看不见。","pronunciation":["깜깜하다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0f5a295a08dcfaf8d883.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83939-2-7-2","ko":"그러게. 요즘은 오후 다섯 시만 지나면 해가 지면서 어둠이 찾아드네.","zh":"是啊。最近一到下午五点，太阳一落山天就黑了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게.","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"요즘은","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오후","meaning":"下午，午后","explanation":"오후：下午，午后","readings":[{"term":"오후","audio":"/audio/7575a29f7d674595d2a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67457","senseId":"1","lemma":"오후","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다섯","meaning":"五","explanation":"다섯：五","readings":[{"term":"다섯","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58111","senseId":"1","lemma":"다섯","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시만","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지나면","meaning":"过，过去","explanation":"지나다：过，过去；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해가","meaning":"太阳","explanation":"해：太阳；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72468","senseId":"1","lemma":"해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지면서","meaning":"落","explanation":"지다：落；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62496","senseId":"1","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어둠이","meaning":"黑暗，昏暗","explanation":"어둠：黑暗，昏暗；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어둠","audio":"/audio/80b84c9158d38546dba3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71586","senseId":"1","lemma":"어둠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾아드네.","meaning":"出现，降临","explanation":"찾아들다：出现，降临；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"찾아들다","audio":"/audio/848254f7ae99a2c77f1e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83939","senseId":"2","lemma":"찾아들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"7575a29f7d674595","term":"오후","zh":"下午，午后","audio":"/audio/7575a29f7d674595d2a0.mp3","entryId":"67457","definition":"从中午到太阳落山的期间。","pronunciation":["오ː후"]},{"id":"0d616c5afd4feb13","term":"다섯","zh":"五","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3","entryId":"58111","definition":"四加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["다섣"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6a12e9123","term":"시","zh":"点，点钟","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3","entryId":"65108","definition":"计时单位，表示一天二十四小时中的某一个。","pronunciation":["시"]},{"id":"7d68e3b7dc1c001c","term":"지나다","zh":"过，过去","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3","entryId":"82142","definition":"随时间流逝，脱离那个时期。","pronunciation":["지나다"]},{"id":"b4ec4274b7799f1f","term":"해","zh":"太阳","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3","entryId":"72468","definition":"位于太阳系的中心，温度极高，自行发光的恒星。","pronunciation":["해"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"落","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"62496","definition":"太阳或月亮西下。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"80b84c9158d38546","term":"어둠","zh":"黑暗，昏暗","audio":"/audio/80b84c9158d38546dba3.mp3","entryId":"71586","definition":"暗的状态或暗的时候。","pronunciation":["어둠"]},{"id":"848254f7ae99a2c7","term":"찾아들다","zh":"出现，降临","audio":"/audio/848254f7ae99a2c77f1e.mp3","entryId":"83939","definition":